---
model: googleai/gemini-2.0-flash
input:
  schema:
    blog_title: string, the primary title of the post
    author_name: string
    tags(array): string, list of relevant tags
    is_published?: boolean, defaults to false
    metadata:
      word_count_target: integer
      seo_keywords(array): string, high-value SEO terms
      category(enum): [TECH, LIFESTYLE, BUSINESS]
    config(object):
      temperature: number
      max_tokens: integer
---
# Blog Post Generation

Write a detailed blog post titled "{{blog_title}}" by {{author_name}}.

{{#if blog_title}}
  The blog post should be centered around the theme of "{{blog_title}}".
{{/if}}

Target Word Count: {{metadata.word_count_target}}
Post Category: {{metadata.category}}

The SEO strategy should focus on: {{metadata.seo_keywords}}

{{#each metadata.seo_keywords}}
- Use keyword: {{this}}
{{/each}}

{{#if is_published}}
Status: Public
{{else}}
Status: Draft
{{/if}}

## Tags
{{#each tags}}
#{{this}} 
{{/each}}

-- System Params --
Temp: {{config.temperature}}
Max: {{config.max_tokens}}
